  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat is working on improvements to how VRChat generates [Impostors](https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-impostors/)! This may make it possible for Impostors to be automatically generated without the involvement of the Avatar creators.\n\nImpostors improve VRChat by replacing avatars with an optimized 3D preview. This allows Android users to see a preview of PC-only avatars, and vice-versa. Impostors also improve performance, especially in crowded instances with poorly optimized avatars.\n\nCurrently, Avatar creators need to generate Impostors themselves. In the future, we'd like VRChat to generate Impostors automatically. Not all Avatars will get an Impostor immediately, and generating Impostors may take a significant amount of time.",
